<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article article-type="correction" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">J Exp Med</journal-id><journal-title>The Journal of Experimental Medicine</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0022-1007</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1540-9538</issn><publisher><publisher-name>The Rockefeller University Press</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2212138</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Correction</subject><subj-group><subject>Corrections</subject></subj-group></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Correction</article-title></title-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><day>16</day><month>2</month><year>1998</year></pub-date><volume>187</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>661</fpage><lpage>661</lpage><copyright-year>1998</copyright-year><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="187" page="185" id="N0x34ed5f0N0x1d9c7d0" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="9432976" ext-link-type="pubmed"/></article-meta></front><body><p>Due to an editorial oversight, W.C. Sha was not made aware of the complementary work of Caama&#x000f1;o et al. (January 19, 1998, 187:185&#x02013;196), published in the  same issue of <italic>The Journal of Experimental Medicine</italic> as Franzoso et al. (187:147&#x02013;159), when writing his commentary &#x0201c;Regulation of immune responses by NF-&#x003ba;B/Rel  transcription factors&#x0201d; (187:143&#x02013;146).</p></body></article>